WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.292
Sometimes we need both the item and its position.

00:00:03.292 --> 00:00:08.792
Enumerate gives us both at the same time.

00:00:08.792 --> 00:00:10.672
Here the customers are Ava, Ben, and Carla.

00:00:10.672 --> 00:00:19.134
Because start equals one, the output uses human-friendly numbering: one Ava, two Ben, three Carla.

00:00:19.621 --> 00:00:26.944
This is useful in reports, ranked lists, and any output where the position matters as much as the value.
